1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:06,060
Being informed is not riding a high horse.

2
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:13,440
Knowing the facts don't mean I think I'm all that.

3
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:28,760
Telling the truth and being direct don't mean I am trying to be elitist.

4
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:31,880
I just want you to listen.

5
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:40,220
And it ain't nothing sweet to say.

6
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:58,400
We just all need to listen to the actual words and not how we want them said.

